<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>mori 管理後台</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="admin.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="admin-extra.css"></head>
<body><header><a href="index.php" class="brand">mori</a><span>管理後台</span><button id="logout" class="hidden">登出</button></header><main>
<section id="access-message" class="access"><h1>正在確認管理員權限…</h1><p>請先從購物網站登入管理員帳號。</p><a href="index.php">回到購物網站</a></section>
<section id="dashboard" class="hidden"><div class="headline"><div><p class="eyebrow">ADMIN CONSOLE</p><h1>商店管理</h1></div><button id="new-product" class="primary">＋ 新增商品</button></div><div id="flash" role="status"></div><nav class="tabs"><button class="tab active" data-view="products">商品管理</button><button class="tab" data-view="orders">所有訂單</button><button class="tab" data-view="categories">商品分類</button></nav>
<section id="products-view" class="view"><div class="toolbar"><input id="search" placeholder="搜尋商品名稱"><select id="status-filter" aria-label="商品狀態"><option value="all">全部商品</option><option value="active">上架中</option><option value="inactive">已下架</option></select><span id="product-count"></span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>商品</th><th>分類</th><th>售價</th><th>庫存</th><th>狀態</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="product-list"></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="orders-view" class="view hidden"><div class="toolbar"><span>所有成立訂單</span><span id="order-count"></span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>訂單編號／時間</th><th>顧客</th><th>商品</th><th>收件資訊</th><th>金額／狀態</th></tr></thead><tbody id="order-list"></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="categories-view" class="view hidden"><div class="category-add"><input id="new-category-name" placeholder="新分類名稱"><input id="new-category-slug" placeholder="英文 slug，例如 decor"><button id="add-category" class="primary">新增分類</button></div><p class="category-help">分類名稱與 slug 都可以編輯。slug 只能使用小寫英文、數字與連字號。</p><div id="category-list" class="category-list"></div></section>
</section></main>
<div id="backdrop" class="backdrop"></div><section id="editor" class="editor" aria-hidden="true"><button id="close" class="close" aria-label="關閉">×</button><h2 id="editor-title">新增商品</h2><form id="product-form"><input type="hidden" id="product-id"><label>商品名稱<input id="name" required maxlength="150"></label><label>分類<select id="category" required></select></label><div class="two"><label>售價（NT$）<input id="price" type="number" min="0" required></label><label>庫存<input id="stock" type="number" min="0" required></label></div><label>商品描述<textarea id="description" maxlength="500"></textarea></label><label>商品圖片 <small>JPEG、PNG、WebP，最多 2MB</small><input id="image-file" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"></label><input type="hidden" id="image-path"><img id="preview" class="hidden" alt="商品圖片預覽"><label class="check"><input id="active" type="checkbox" checked> 上架販售</label><p id="form-error" class="error"></p><button class="primary">儲存商品</button></form></section><script src="admin.js"></script></body></html>
